+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a cache eviction policy. A search of the repository's documentation (`AGENTS.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `docs/`) and git history turned up no ADR, policy statement, or maintainer decision specifying which eviction strategy (LRU, LFU, or otherwise) should be used; the repository does contain example implementations of several eviction algorithms (e.g. `other/lru_cache.py`, `other/lfu_cache.py`, `other/least_recently_used.py`), but these are educational algorithm demonstrations, not a statement of project policy.
